# Model weights are downloaded/exported here at setup time, never committed.
# Expected files (see .env.example):
#   retinaface_mobilenet0.25.pth   - biubug6 Pytorch_Retinaface (MobileNet0.25)
#   retinaface_resnet50.pth        - biubug6 Pytorch_Retinaface (ResNet50, optional)
#   yolov8n-face.pt                - YOLOv8-face weights
#   detector.onnx                  - produced by scripts/export_onnx.py
